@startuml state_parser_firmware
title Firmware packet receiver (KSPBoardReceiveData)

[*] --> Idle

state Idle : rx_len == 0
state Header : read until 0xBE, then 0xEF,\nthen size and id
state Payload : accumulate bytes into buffer\nuntil rx_len bytes + checksum
state Verify : XOR of size and payload\nvs received checksum

Idle --> Header : more than 3 bytes available
Header --> Idle : second byte is not 0xEF\nor size != sizeof(struct for that id)\n(rx_len reset to 0)
Header --> Payload : size matches the expected struct
Payload --> Payload : bytes still missing\n(function returns false, call again)
Payload --> Verify : all bytes received
Verify --> Idle : checksum good:\nmemcpy into HPacket or VData,\nreturn true
Verify --> Idle : checksum bad:\ndrop packet, return false
@enduml
